From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:11:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 45/47] rpi-firmwared: bt_power, the BT_ON line of the Pi 3B+
 Bluetooth chip

BT_ON hangs on the firmware's GPIO expander (pin 0, firmware GPIO 128),
so only the firmware can switch it. Reading gives 0 or 1, writing 0 or 1
sets it. Pi 3B+ only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/rpi-firmwared/src/main.rs | 38 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 36 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

